# B1b.1b — the six verbs the page presses in local mode, in the same order.
#
# ⚠ NO `at` AND NO `face`. The page has no walk in local mode (`B1c`), so its
# author is `author_on(w, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0)` and stays there — and this script has to
# stand in exactly the same place or the comparison is measuring a pose.
#
# ⚠ `place` IS REFUSED HERE, ON BOTH SIDES, and it is kept for that reason: at yaw
# 0 on the origin a footprint has no mitred corners. A refusal that reproduces is
# evidence; leaving it out would be choosing the fixture to suit the answer.
verb raise
verb raise
verb place
verb fence
verb wall
verb lower
